---
title: Example · Where buyers shop
config:
  look: handDrawn
  handDrawnSeed: 5
  theme: dark
  themeVariables:
    venn1: "#93c5fd"
    venn2: "#c4b5fd"
    venn3: "#fcd34d"
---
%% `set id["Label"]:size` declares a set; `union a,b["Label"]:size` labels an overlap of earlier sets.
%% `:size` sets the circle size; indented `text id["…"]` lines place members inside the latest set or union. Identifiers may be bare words or quoted strings.
%% A body `title …` line is the alternative to frontmatter `title`.
venn-beta
  set web["Web"]:40
    text w1["Desktop checkout"]
  set app["Mobile app"]:30
    text a1["Push offers"]
  set market["Marketplace"]:20
  union web,app["Cross-device"]:12
    text x1["Saved carts"]
  union web,app,market["All three"]:3
